{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And if a man lies with her.</b> Without intent, but he lies with her unwittingly, and her menstrual flow has arrived and she was with him. This is the reason for 'upon him,' for there is karet for one who lies with a menstruating woman intentionally, and likewise is the law of the zavah, and if it were not stated:" "<b>And everything on which she lies shall become impure.</b> For she is impure with seven-day impurity and also defiles others, and if it were not written:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:18.901563618Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}